Z||000011||FieroJoe||02-10-2001||09:50 PM||||I have found that Rain-X works great with my wipers.  I use Rain-X on all my cars, and it helps the wipers wipe cleaner in my opinion.  It always helps to have new(er) blades too, and arms that have enough guts left in the springs for the correct torsion.<P>I'll swear by Rain-X anyday, great product! (it actually does what it says it does..) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
